# Parkinson's disease external news feed source package (pipe-delimited)
#
# These feeds are separate from the condition pack because their permissions
# are restrictive, work-specific, unverified, or involve an intermediary index.
# Every source is disabled by default. Installation requires acceptance of the
# Health Signal external news feed sources agreement.
#
# Health Signal displays headline, date, publisher attribution and an outbound
# link only. It does not reproduce article bodies or images.
#
source_id|name|endpoint|category|feed_kind|enabled_by_default|publisher|classification|reviewed|fields_displayed|permission|commercial_use|attribution|terms_url|rights_or_corrections_contact|notes
medlineplus-parkinsons|MedlinePlus · Parkinson's Disease|https://medlineplus.gov/feeds/topics/parkinsonsdisease.xml|Research|headlineOnly|false|MedlinePlus / U.S. National Library of Medicine|Official topic RSS with restricted reuse|31 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, source attribution and outbound link only|MedlinePlus offers the topic RSS feed, but its content-use policy limits feeds to personal use and does not authorize use in websites or information services|Not authorized by the published RSS terms|Credit MedlinePlus and the U.S. National Library of Medicine and link to the original page|https://medlineplus.gov/about/using/usingcontent/|https://medlineplus.gov/about/contactus.html|Verified responsive Parkinson's-specific RSS endpoint. Disabled and agreement-gated; linked pages can include licensed third-party material.
nlm-news-parkinsons|National Library of Medicine · News|https://www.nlm.nih.gov/rss/nlmnews.rss|Research|headlineOnly|false|U.S. National Library of Medicine|Official broad NLM news RSS; locally filtered|31 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, NLM attribution and outbound link only|NLM states that U.S. government works on its sites may be freely used in the United States with source acknowledgement; third-party contributions can retain copyright|Government works may be reused; verify any linked third-party material and do not imply NLM endorsement|Credit the National Library of Medicine and link to the original item|https://www.nlm.nih.gov/web_policies.html|https://support.nlm.nih.gov/|Verified live broad NLM News RSS endpoint. Disabled and locally filtered for explicit Parkinson's relevance; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
