who-news-parkinsons|World Health Organization · News|https://www.who.int/rss-feeds/news-english.xml|News|headlineOnly|false|World Health Organization|Official international public-health news feed|31 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, source attribution and outbound link only|WHO content is not uniformly public domain. WHO and third-party copyright and licensing notices apply to each linked work|Not verified for the feed; WHO states that commercial uses can require permission|Credit the World Health Organization and link to the original item without implying endorsement|https://www.who.int/about/policies/publishing/copyright|https://www.who.int/about/contact-us|Verified live broad RSS endpoint and locally filtered for explicit Parkinson's relevance. No WHO logo, article body, image or full summary is reproduced.
patient-info-health-parkinsons|Patient.info · Patient information|https://patient.info/health/rss|Research|headlineOnly|false|Patient / Navigate Health Ltd|Broad clinical information RSS with restrictive general terms|31 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, source attribution and outbound link only|Patient's RSS page permits publishers and healthcare sites to embed its feeds without licensing or API access; its general terms separately restrict structured medical-resource and automated content reuse|RSS embedding is expressly described, while broader structured reuse requires written permission|Credit Patient.info and link to the original article|https://patient.info/terms-and-conditions|https://patient.info/contact|Verified responsive broad RSS endpoint and locally filtered for explicit Parkinson's relevance. Disabled by default and agreement-gated; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
